@startuml deposit-robustness
!pragma layout smetana
title 图 2-3 存款鲁棒图
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam linetype ortho
left to right direction

actor "客户\nACT-C" as CustomerActor
actor "模拟资金渠道\nACT-F" as ChannelActor
boundary "DepositForm\n存款表单" as Form
boundary "DepositController\n存款接口" as Controller
boundary "ChannelGateway\n模拟渠道适配边界" as Gateway
control "DepositService\n存款用例编排" as Deposit
control "AccessService\n身份与对象权限" as Access
control "IdempotencyService\n原子受理与重复判定" as Idempotency
control "PostingService\n一致入账与确认" as Posting
entity "Account\n账户状态与余额" as Account
entity "Transaction\n请求与处理状态" as Transaction
entity "FundEntry\n不可变资金流水" as FundEntry
entity "RiskRule\n存款独立单笔上限" as RiskRule

CustomerActor --> Form
Form --> Controller : 提交请求／展示结果
Controller --> Deposit : 调用用例
Deposit --> Access : 身份、账户归属
Access --> Account : 读取归属与授权对象
Access --> Transaction : 读取既有交易所属身份
Deposit --> Idempotency : claimOrLoad
Idempotency --> Transaction : 唯一受理权／原结果
Deposit --> Account : 新请求状态检查
Deposit --> RiskRule : 金额与存款上限
Deposit --> Gateway : 按原 tradeNo 请求／核对
Gateway --> ChannelActor : 模拟入金与稳定结果查询
Deposit --> Posting : 明确结果的一致提交
Posting --> Account : 增加账面余额，R 不变
Posting --> Transaction : 终态与重复确认判定
Posting --> FundEntry : 追加实际入账记录

note bottom of Posting
余额变动、FundEntry、成功状态为同一业务提交。
不允许界面／渠道直接改余额。
end note
note bottom of Deposit
BR-03：冻结拒绝新存款；已受理交易继续确认。
BR-11/12：相同请求返回原状态，不重复入账。
BR-13/19：成功才入账；失败／未知不生成资金流水。
end note
legend bottom
边界：界面、接口与外部通道；控制：组织用例与一致性；实体：业务状态。
外部参与者不计入表 2-1 的设计类。全部类名与图 2-6、表 2-1 对应。
endlegend
@enduml
